<title>USA: Oregon $155 mln COPs restructured, top yld steady.</title>
<headline>Oregon $155 mln COPs restructured, top yld steady.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. said Wednesday it restructured Oregon's $155 million certificates of participation issue, but left the top yield in 2024 unchanged at 5.95 percent.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:</p>
<p>STATE OF OREGON</p>
<p>DEPARTMENT OF ADMINISTRATIVE SERVICES</p>
<p>RE: $154,895,000*</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION,</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA		 FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>	     A1 (CONFIRMED)	 A+ (CONFIRMED)  A+ (CONFIRMED)</p>
